WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.410
- I heard that you actually met your

00:00:01.410 --> 00:00:02.580
husband on the set of "Beetlejuice."

00:00:02.580 --> 00:00:03.690
- I did, yeah.

00:00:03.690 --> 00:00:06.870
He was a production designer,
designed all those wild sets

00:00:06.870 --> 00:00:09.750
and they actually did redid
the whole house on the same

00:00:09.750 --> 00:00:11.220
hill in Vermont for this second...

00:00:11.220 --> 00:00:12.053
- For the second one?

00:00:12.053 --> 00:00:13.410
- The second, "Beetlejuice."

00:00:13.410 --> 00:00:15.390
But yeah, he was talking to me every day.

00:00:15.390 --> 00:00:16.890
It was like high school, he's just talking

00:00:16.890 --> 00:00:18.480
to me every day like, by our lockers.

00:00:18.480 --> 00:00:19.830
And then he never asked me out

00:00:19.830 --> 00:00:23.400
and then he went on to
prep the stuff in Vermont

00:00:23.400 --> 00:00:24.870
and I'm grousing to Tim Burton about

00:00:24.870 --> 00:00:26.250
how the production
designer never asked me.

00:00:26.250 --> 00:00:27.750
And he said, "Let me see what I can do."

00:00:27.750 --> 00:00:30.300
And I got there, first
day of shooting there.

00:00:30.300 --> 00:00:31.350
Bo's off to the side.

00:00:31.350 --> 00:00:32.610
Bo Welch is his name.

00:00:32.610 --> 00:00:35.040
He comes over, goes, "Oh,

00:00:35.040 --> 00:00:36.600
the art department's going to swap meet.

00:00:36.600 --> 00:00:38.220
You want to come with us?"

00:00:38.220 --> 00:00:39.240
- [Kelly] Wow.

00:00:39.240 --> 00:00:40.260
- It's like he'd been forced.

00:00:40.260 --> 00:00:42.510
- Really reeling you in, yeah,

00:00:42.510 --> 00:00:43.343
- I guess.

00:00:43.343 --> 00:00:44.970
But Tim was right, he made it happen.

00:00:44.970 --> 00:00:46.320
- I love that, you got set up.

00:00:46.320 --> 00:00:49.500
This is actually for some
reason tracks for me,

00:00:49.500 --> 00:00:51.630
but like, as a gift, a wedding gift,

00:00:51.630 --> 00:00:53.700
he gave you a tour of the Vatican.

00:00:53.700 --> 00:00:56.010
- Tim did, yeah, a private, no, private.

00:00:56.010 --> 00:00:58.350
- Okay, but I'm just like,
that is the most random

00:00:58.350 --> 00:01:00.059
wedding gift I've ever heard of.

00:01:00.059 --> 00:01:00.892
- And to me?

00:01:00.892 --> 00:01:01.725
- How is it possible?

00:01:01.725 --> 00:01:02.558
- Somebody had given it to him.

00:01:02.558 --> 00:01:04.380
I don't know, it's a
very inside kind of deal.

00:01:04.380 --> 00:01:05.670
- [Kelly] What was the...

00:01:05.670 --> 00:01:07.140
- Okay, a priest took us around.

00:01:07.140 --> 00:01:09.060
He got yelled at at one point.

00:01:09.060 --> 00:01:11.100
I wish I spoke Italian, but he
was definitely getting yelled

00:01:11.100 --> 00:01:13.950
at by another priest because
we were in the pope's closet.

00:01:13.950 --> 00:01:16.350
Like, looking at garments
and stuff, it was crazy.

00:01:16.350 --> 00:01:18.720
We were in the elevator that he takes down

00:01:18.720 --> 00:01:20.850
to St. Peter's Basilica to do mass.

00:01:20.850 --> 00:01:25.110
We were in this lovely
little, like a tiny museum

00:01:25.110 --> 00:01:28.230
where all the gifts to the
Vatican from every country,

00:01:28.230 --> 00:01:30.540
from every country leader in the world.

00:01:30.540 --> 00:01:31.530
Gifts that had been sent to the

00:01:31.530 --> 00:01:33.637
Vatican since the
beginning of the Vatican.

00:01:33.637 --> 00:01:35.580
And this priest is letting us open cases

00:01:35.580 --> 00:01:36.930
and pretending to put a crown

00:01:36.930 --> 00:01:39.510
inside Bo's backpack, taking pictures.

00:01:39.510 --> 00:01:41.130
I wish I had those pictures with me.

00:01:41.130 --> 00:01:42.000
Just crazy.

00:01:42.000 --> 00:01:44.010
- You don't have these pictures?

00:01:44.010 --> 00:01:45.300
- Somewhere I do, yeah.

00:01:45.300 --> 00:01:46.920
- [Kelly] Oh man, that's amazing.

00:01:46.920 --> 00:01:48.300
- Yeah, it was beautiful gift.

00:01:48.300 --> 00:01:50.232
- It's such a random gift, very memorable,

00:01:50.232 --> 00:01:51.720
I'll give a that.

00:01:51.720 --> 00:01:54.810
- You were rummaging
around the pope's closet.

00:01:54.810 --> 00:01:55.890
- [Kelly] As one does.

00:01:55.890 --> 00:01:56.723
- That's like, when you're like...

00:01:56.723 --> 00:01:57.997
- I hate to say this out loud, sorry.

00:01:57.997 --> 00:01:59.130
- Go into like, real estate or something

00:01:59.130 --> 00:02:00.840
and you're like, oh, I'm
just gonna go like walk into

00:02:00.840 --> 00:02:03.120
these open houses and you're
just gonna peek around

00:02:03.120 --> 00:02:04.488
a little bit.

00:02:04.488 --> 00:02:05.920
- No, no, yes, no, no.

